OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Frather cloudy evening and night with
OL,7,Fscattered showers giving way to some
OL,8,Fheavier and more persistent outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain, especially in Lancashire and
OL,10,FCumbria. Southern areas may remain
OL,11,Fmostly dry. A warmer and more humid
OL,12,Fnight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FRather cloudy at first with
OL,15,Fshowery rain possible. Brightening up
OL,16,Fwith sunny intervals and a chance of
OL,17,Fscattered heavy showers. Warm and
OL,18,Fhumid but not as hot as on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
