OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCooler
OL,6,Fand rather windy on Wednesday with
OL,7,Fshowers possible. Turning notably
OL,8,Ffresher for Thursday and Friday but
OL,9,Fbecoming less breezy. Occasional
OL,10,Fshowers likely but also some warm
OL,11,Fsunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
